window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>An OCD twin from a parallel universe. A meddling ghost. A desperate plea for help.</b></p> <p>With her new café thriving, Quinn is trying to keep up with the bizarre twist her life has taken.</p> <p>But when her best friend Toni's cousin shows up with a suitcase, a mysterious man, and a risky request, Quinn makes a decision that lands her in hot water.</p> <p>Things take a turn for the worse when the police arrest the cousin for murder.</p> <p>Faced with a slack sheriff, a growing list of suspects, and a missing fortune, the two midlife friends dive into the investigation while Quinn grapples with the moral implications of enlisting her unpredictable ghostly companions to uncover the truth.</p> <p>Will Quinn go to any lengths to deliver justice to those in need? And is she prepared to face the repercussions of crossing the line between the living, the dead, and the mysterious in-between?</p> <p><i>If you're a fan of fast-paced, humorous, lighthearted stories that keep you guessing, you'll love</i> A Spirited Vengeance<i>, Book 3 in the Midlife is Murder paranormal cozy mystery series.</i></p>"; 
